ee years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at -148% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $51M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at -56.1% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, thin -8.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 364% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 23% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-3.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (17.0% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Technology peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 1543% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 56/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Technology peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 208% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"(NN) and the Role of Price-Sensitive Allocations","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/81/NN_and_the_Role_of_Price-Sensitive_Allocations_110526054401_1793875441.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793875441.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"NN (NASDAQ:NNBR) Cut to \u201cHold\u201d at Wall Street Zen","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/03/nn-nasdaqnnbr-cut-to-hold-at-wall-street-zen.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793687453.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.527,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Critical Contrast: NN (NNBR) versus Its Rivals","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/02/critical-contrast-nn-nnbr-versus-its-rivals.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793675693.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.7,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"NN (NASDAQ:NNBR) Releases Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Estimates By $0.05 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/28/nn-nasdaqnnbr-releases-quarterly-earnings-results-beats-estimates-by-0-05-eps.html","date":"2026-10-28","timesta